1. I retain rights to work completed solely by me;
2. TNO may use my work without restriction with the exception that it may not redistribute my work in separation from the Mod and promotional materials without my permission;
3. I cannot claim ownership over and redistribute any work I, in collaboration with others, did for TNO without permission from every collaborator; 
4. This agreement between me and TNO remains effective after my separation from TNO's development team; and
5. This agreement between me and TNO applies retroactively to all of my work done for TNO prior to the effective day of this agreement; this includes works done for sub-mods that are scheduled for integration with TNO.

